{"title":"„Was machst du lieber?“","puid":"c-deu-a2/ysdpfx","path":"/../c-deu-a2/topic-03-freizeit-hobbies/block-01-am-liebsten-treffe-ich-freunde/level-03","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","keyboardLayout":"standardDE","voice":"m1Poly","instruction":{"voice":"f2Poly","autoplay":false},"trainers":[{"trainer":"gapMulti","gapMode":"buttons","design":"dialogue","instruction":{"text":"Setze ein.","speaker":true},"shuffleButtons":false,"textAlign":"left","soundMode":"b","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-deu-a2/topic-03-freizeit-hobbies/block-01-am-liebsten-treffe-ich-freunde/lsg/03_Dialog.lsg","width":250},"atoms":[{"b":"Ich gehe gleich einkaufen, weil ich einen Kuchen backen muss.","voice":"m15_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-deu-a2/shared-neu/teens/teenager-13.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"b":"Gehst du gern ((++einkaufen schwimmen spazieren))?","voice":"f6_2025","person":{"lsg":"/../c-deu-a2/shared-neu/teens/teenager-5.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"b":"Nein! Ich treffe mich ((++lieber lieb liebsten)) mit Freunden oder gehe ins Kino.","voice":"m15_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-deu-a2/shared-neu/teens/teenager-13.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"b":"Ich gehe nicht ((++gern groß gut)) ins Kino. Ich gehe lieber in den Park. ((++Am Im Auf)) liebsten spiele ich dort Tischtennis.","voice":"f6_2025","person":{"lsg":"/../c-deu-a2/shared-neu/teens/teenager-5.lsg"},"position":"left"}]},{"trainer":"imageButtons","instruction":{"text":"Wähle die richtige Antwort aus.","speaker":true},"soundMode":"a","lsg":{"width":250},"onSamePage":true,"shuffleButtons":true,"shuffleAtoms":false,"atoms":[{"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-deu-a2/shared-neu/teens/teenager-5.lsg","width":150},"a":"Was macht Lola lieber?","b":[{"lsg":"/../c-deu-a2/topic-03-freizeit-hobbies/block-01-am-liebsten-treffe-ich-freunde/lsg/03_iButton_Park.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-deu-a2/topic-03-freizeit-hobbies/block-01-am-liebsten-treffe-ich-freunde/lsg/03_iButton_Kino.lsg"}]},{"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-deu-a2/shared-neu/teens/teenager-13.lsg","width":150},"